iFixit today took apart Apple's touchscreen PROLED <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/macbook-pro/">MacBook Pro</a> to see how Apple shed weight, what powers the logo, and how it compares to the 14-inch M6 &zwnj;MacBook Pro&zwnj;.<br/>
<br/>
